      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내내~",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B4B0B4007E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런데 흉내내가 우편물을 회수하는 게\n이번이 처음이라 걱정이 된단 말이죠...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F0B3700020D749B0B4B0B4AC000020C6B0D3B8BB3CC7440020D68CC218D558B2940020AC8C000AC774BC88C7740020CC98C74CC774B77C0020AC71C815C7740020B41CB2E80020B9D0C774C8E0002E002E002E00100002011401BF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잘하고 있는지 지켜보고 싶지만,\n제가 쫓아가면 금방 들켜 버리고 말 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C798D558ACE00020C788B294C9C00020C9C0CF1CBCF4ACE00020C2F6C9C0B9CC002C000AC81CAC000020CAD3C544AC00BA740020AE08BC290020B4E4CF1C0020BC84B9ACACE00020B9D00020AC70C608C694002E00100002011401BF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부탁드릴게요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n저를 대신해서\n흉내내가 일하는 모습을 지켜봐 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80D0C1B4DCB9B4AC8CC694002100100001BE01000AC800B97C0020B300C2E0D574C11C000AD749B0B4B0B4AC000020C77CD558B2940020BAA8C2B5C7440020C9C0CF1CBD100020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401BF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "흉내내를 지켜볼 준비가 되시면\n제게 말을 걸어 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D749B0B4B0B4B97C0020C9C0CF1CBCFC0020C900BE44AC000020B418C2DCBA74000AC81CAC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401BF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
