      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "흉내내의 첫 우편물 회수를\n지켜볼 준비는 되셨나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
